# harus fork: what `npm pack` leaves out of the release tarball (see HARUS.md).
# Rendered example pages are demos; the skill reads only examples/*.json.
examples/*.html
# Contributor-only: tests and the generators of committed files.
test/
scripts/generate-*.mjs
# No release metadata: the update check then stops before any cache write or
# fetch, so the tarball never calls upstream or suggests reinstalling from it.
skill-release.json
